{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"AC5 amended 2026-11-17, authorized by the operator: the last criterion now accepts a Live External Integration run on main (scheduled or workflow_dispatch) whose head contains both this fix and the deceptive-banal-baboon change. The scheduled run it originally named (43815882263, 2026-11-15 22:18 PST) failed only on a Bedrock 503 outage tracked by leady-soldierly-nurseshark (closed). The operator's decision explicitly supersedes the 2026-11-09 note that the criteria must not be changed to fit the evidence. All other conditions are kept.\n\nEvidence for AC5: run https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/43980867796\n- event: workflow_dispatch; branch: main; head SHA 5909040828603167b39fab1595cb28f000137986. Both 91182f96362 (deceptive-banal-baboon fix, Gerrit 3336) and 5c95bd690df (this fix, Gerrit 3278) are ancestors of that head (git merge-base --is-ancestor).\n- created 2026-11-16 15:37:20 PST, completed 15:59:12 PST; workflow conclusion: success.\n- Per-job conclusions: langfuse tracing round-trip (ephemeral self-hosted) success (15:37:24-15:39:54 PST); external LLM (live bedrock) success; external LLM (live anthropic) success; external LLM (live openai) success; external integration (live services) success; jira Cloud coordinator mutation probe success; jira DC harness smoke success; Pandoc corpus replay (ubuntu-latest) success; Pandoc corpus replay (macos-latest) success; jira Cloud + S3 rehearsal (read-only) skipped.\n- MinIO pull: in the langfuse job, step `docker compose -f docker-compose.langfuse.yml up -d` logged \"Image cgr.dev/chainguard/minio@sha256:3c60a2a8c4d33409a9bc7a623a7fcbfb4605adc3d89422d2f53b3f673a6e5597 Pulled\" (15:38:18 PST), then \"Container rebar-minio-1 Started\" and \"Healthy\"; the job went on to the health probe, the trace round-trip pytest step, and compose down. The job log contains 0 matches for unauthorized/denied/##[error]."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1794936745929336157,"uuid":"0dfab439-c1a3-4242-8188-1ec97f951405"}